@host = http://localhost:5281

### Create a factor
POST {{host}}/factors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sleep", "unit": "hours" }

### List factors
GET {{host}}/factors

### Log a mood entry (factorId 1 = Sleep)
POST {{host}}/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mood": 7, "notes": "Feeling decent", "factors": [ { "factorId": 1, "value": 6.5 } ] }

### List entries
GET {{host}}/entries
